  "示例：=SUBSTITUTE(\"aaabbccc\", \"bc\", \"BC\", 2) 返回“aaabbccc”": "Ejemplo: =SUSTITUIR(\"aaabbccc\", \"bc\", \"BC\", 2) devuelve \"aaabbccc\"",
  "示例：=FINDA(\"(X2022)2f8f0af(NZP001)\",\"(\",\")\")，结果：X2022,NZP001": "Ejemplo: =FINDA(\"(X2022)2f8f0af(NZP001)\",\"(\",\")\"), devuelve: X2022,NZP001",
